	(text "VERIFY WIPER VOLTAGES ON BENCH BEFORE POWER-ON.\nIf any wiper exceeds 3.3V at B+1 = 6V, add resistor\ndivider on Sheet 5 before the clamp diodes.\nSee signal-chain-analysis.md §4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.674 78.232 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "038e9557-7ce2-4a58-a330-b9f3beaaa5a0")
	)
	(text "R5 holds BOOT0 low at reset → normal boot from flash.\nTo enter system bootloader: pull PA14 high before reset\nvia SWD header. Do not remove R5 - floating BOOT0\ncauses unpredictable boot behavior."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "24d1cb85-27aa-44cf-89e7-b42f826f79a8")
	)
	(text "PA9/PA10 can remap to PA11/PA12 pins\nvia SYSCFG_CFGR1. Do not remap while USB is active.\nPCB: route as 90Ω differential pair, matched length,\n≤25mm, away from MT3608 SW node."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.674 104.902 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6009c1d0-5be7-4c6b-a21b-ac4ecd383292")
	)
	(text "CC1 (PA8) and CC2 (PA9) connect to both IP2721 (PD\nnegotiation) and STM32 UCPD1 (monitoring/control).\nFirmware must clear SYSCFG_CFGR1 UCPD_STROBE early\nin startup - see RM0444 §28 for UCPD init sequence."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.928 95.504 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "85145d24-d753-40b5-a0fc-2e6f1d89b873")
	)
	(text "C11 (C0G) must be placed closest to pin 4 on PCB.\nC0G for ADC noise - do not substitute X5R here.\nEP (pin 33): via array 2×2 or 3×3 grid, 0.3mm drill."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 173.482 43.942 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d4010868-48ac-4afa-b891-f5c795da262f")
	)
